sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Web Client
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant File as File Service
    participant Kafka as Kafka Broker
    participant AI as AI Service
    participant Webhook as Webhook Service

    User->>API: POST /files (Upload Document)
    API->>File: Forward Request
    File->>File: Save to S3 & Postgres
    File->>Kafka: Publish "FileUploadedEvent"
    File-->>API: 201 Created
    API-->>User: Success Response

    Note over Kafka, AI: Asynchronous Processing
    Kafka->>AI: Consume "FileUploadedEvent"
    AI->>AI: Extract Text (OCR) & Summarize
    AI->>Kafka: Publish "DocumentAnalyzedEvent"

    Kafka->>Webhook: Consume "DocumentAnalyzedEvent"
    Webhook->>Webhook: Check Client Subscriptions
    Webhook->>User: POST to Client Webhook URL
